meta {
  name: Create Application Payment
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admissions/application-payments
  body: multipartForm
  auth: none
}

body:multipart-form {
  enquiryGuid: 3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6
  oDelIntApplication: 0
  studentName: John Doe
  intakeGuid: 3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6
  campusGuid: 3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6
  programGuid: 3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6
  semesterGuid: 3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6
  batchGuid: 3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6
  batchTimeGuid: 3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6
  feeHdGuid: 3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6
  countryGuid: 3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6
  mobile: 700000000
  email: john.doe@example.com
  exemptionTypeGuid: null
  payDate: 28/Jul/2026
  payType: 1
  amount: 50000.00
  currencyGuid: 3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6
  exRate: 1.0
  bankGuid: null
  receiptBookGuid: null
  remarks: Application payment
  payProofFile: null
}

docs {
  Records an application payment. Accepts multipart/form-data to support an optional payment proof file upload.

  Field notes:
  - `enquiryGuid` (optional): links the payment to an existing enquiry.
  - `programGuid`: GUID of the programme — stored directly; no integer lookup required.
  - `batchTimeGuid` replaces old `intBatchTime` integer field.
  - `feeHdGuid` replaces old `intFee` integer field.
  - `countryGuid` replaces old `countryCode` string field.
  - `exemptionTypeGuid` replaces old `exemptionType` integer field.
  - `payDate` must be in dd/MMM/yyyy format (e.g. 28/Jul/2026).
  - When `exemptionTypeGuid` is provided, `amount`, `currencyGuid`, `exRate`, `payType`, and `receiptBookGuid` are not required.
  - `bankGuid` is required when `payType > 1` (non-cash payments).

  Success (201): data = CreateApplicationPaymentResponse.
  Failure: 400 `validation_error` or `bad_request`.
}
